{"version":1,"content":"<p>iPhone Duo上市不到一周，屏幕故障突然成為了輿論焦點。多名用户反映，新機在展開過程中出現異響，隨後屏幕摺痕附近出現裂紋、白線，部分設備甚至出現黑屏。蘋果官方回應稱，已經注意到少數設備的內屏問題，並建議用户聯繫AppleCare處理。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1584140.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-10-28T07:42:59.320947+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":125,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-28T07:18:43+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-28T07:38:17.450748+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-28T07:38:17.450748+00:00","content_hash":"f0f6e049eba4fb27da1d6454f19d1333221b13aa93bce56ab02d5da4b22b1623","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}